# Butler Routes - Ashenvale rares and treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 12 confirmed in-band rares and the fixed world
# containers of Ashenvale. Run it in its own Polestar tab at the end of the
# core route or standalone. EVERY goal is optional: a rare that is not up never
# holds the route. Spawn points and levels are the local Forever game data
# (questie-forever); the data records no loot on any of these twelve rares, so
# there are no signature drops to chase and no tame lines ship either (no loot
# evidence, no core-guide corroboration — see docs/companion-unverified.md).
# Respawn timers are unconfirmed anywhere, so none are stated. Apothecary
# Falthis is Horde-aligned but attackable; Varo'then's Ghost (level 48) lives
# far above the zone band and is not covered here. No rare in this guide is a
# giver, ender, or objective of any core-contracted quest; the Tome of
# Mel'Thandris and the Tower soul objects are quest-owned and live in the core
# route, not here. See docs/ashenvale-companions-inventory.md for the full
# inventory this guide was built against.
guide butler-routes-completionist/ashenvale-rares
title Ashenvale - Rares & Treasures
levels 18-32
zone Ashenvale
faction Alliance
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords ashenvale, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

step Apothecary Falthis — the far north

  loop
  goto 32.64,21.98
  goto 33.17,21.91
  goto 33.2,21.1
  kill 3735 optional
  note Level 22 rare, flagged rare in the data. Horde-aligned, but attackable — kill it like any other rare.
  note The data records no loot on this rare at all, and no quest references it; respawn timer unconfirmed.

