  note Four Battered Chest placements, nineteen Solid Chest placements, twenty-four Barrel of Melon Juice placements with matching Food Crates, one Food Crate with its Barrel of Milk, four Weapon Crate placements with matching Armor Crates, two eastern Food Crates, thirty-nine Rusty Chest placements, one Worn Chest, fourteen Troll Chest placements, twelve Waterlogged Footlocker placements, and three Vibrating Crates. All hold ordinary low-level goods; no unique treasure confirmed.
  note The Tome of Mel'Thandris and the Tower soul objects are quest-owned and routed in the core guide, not here. Respawn timers unconfirmed.
